    <item>
      <title>d204.10: ghosts</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-ghosts/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-ghosts/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;d204 is a project where i take a list of eighty songs that i wrote &amp;amp; record whichever one comes up when i roll a d20 &amp;amp; a d4&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/pymoob/d204_10_result.jpg#center&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-song&#34;&gt;the song&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/IfrxKMYtPAQI?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;i breathe deep driving past graveyards&lt;br&gt;&#xA;’cause i’ve felt trapped &amp;amp; i bet when you’ve died&lt;br&gt;&#xA;lying with your body in the dirt is hard&lt;br&gt;&#xA;so i’m ok with giving a ride to anyone to anything to anyone&lt;br&gt;&#xA;brave enough to hop inside&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
