    <item>
      <title>d204 reroll</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-reroll/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 28 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-reroll/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;315-pm&#34;&gt;3:15 pm&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;my first try at rolling song #6, the dice gave me another song from &lt;em&gt;culpable&lt;/em&gt;, and… please. c’mon. like. Please. unfortunately i don’t have the recording of myself making that call because when i read the result i immediately stopped the recording to stare at the dice silently while i tried to figure out what i wanted to do &amp;amp; in my frazzled state closed it without saving, so there’s no evidence. regardless, i want to share that it happened, because i think it’s very, very funny how much the dice want me to record stuff from that album&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
