    <item>
      <title>d204.03: a poet &amp; an alcoholic in times of war</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-a-poet-and-an-alcoholic-in-times-of-war/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-a-poet-and-an-alcoholic-in-times-of-war/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;d204 is a project where i take a list of eighty songs that i wrote &amp;amp; record whichever one comes up when i roll a d20 &amp;amp; a d4&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/pymoob/d204_03_result.jpg#center&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-song&#34;&gt;the song&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/MSZXZIyuh0w?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;time heals nothing&lt;br&gt;&#xA;the wound heals itself&lt;br&gt;&#xA;time just passes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-vlog&#34;&gt;the vlog&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;started working on this in january &amp;amp; then got hurled face first into an absurdly busy semester in a way i REALLY wasn’t expecting. finally had the time to start working on it again in april, &amp;amp; now here we are. very glad, in some ways, for that “break”– i did a little cabaret/musical at one point in there &amp;amp; having a reason to sing regularly again made hitting that last “TIIIME” way easier than it was in january ! 😬&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>d204.02: hands in mouths</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-hands-in-mouths/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 22 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-hands-in-mouths/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;d204 is a project where i take a list of eighty songs that i wrote &amp;amp; record whichever one comes up when i roll a d20 &amp;amp; a d4&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/pymoob/d204_02_result.jpg#center&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-song&#34;&gt;the song&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/UKfh7gxNvk8?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;i don’t believe in god, but the book is just a symbol&lt;br&gt;&#xA;i don’t believe in family, but the history is simple&lt;br&gt;&#xA;so i put my hand on my grandmother’s bible&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&amp;amp; i swear i will not love you anymore&lt;br&gt;&#xA;i will not kiss your lipstick stains&lt;br&gt;&#xA;i will not haunt your windowpanes&lt;br&gt;&#xA;i will not tape poetry to your front door&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
